// Description: Retrieves recent network activity to Microsoft-related domains for visibility and baseline analysis
// Data Source: DeviceNetworkEvents
// Time Range: 30 days
// Use Case: Network telemetry review / baseline building
// False Positives: Expected high volume due to Windows, M365, and Azure services

DeviceNetworkEvents  
| where Timestamp > ago(30d)
| where RemoteUrl has_any (dynamic([ "microsoft"
]))
| project Timestamp, DeviceName, RemoteUrl, ActionType, InitiatingProcessCommandLine
| top 100 by Timestamp desc
